IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `apa-passports`

-- Australian Passports Act 2005 (Cth), with the Australian Passports Determination 2015 and the Australian Passports
-- (Application Fees) Determination 2015 -- worked cases from the seat of the applicant (and, for a child, the parents).
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case, the pre-2015 text of s 11, the Australian Passports Determination 2005, or departmental practice.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_australian-passports-act-2005_baseline.py).
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts the lives do not state are ASSUMPTIONS, labelled where used: that both parents had parental responsibility and
-- consented (the Chloe scenario says "with both parents' consent"; for Jake, Oliver and Anjali it is assumed); Anjali's
-- application date after her citizenship by descent was approved (1 Sep 2027, the date assumed in the citizenship baseline);
-- the indexation factors, which are ILLUSTRATIVE, not the published figures.

-- Applications.
