#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Anjali, 0, in London, after approval, both parents consent` EQUALS `I am entitled to be issued a passport`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, no parent consents, his 2016 passport expired (k035, 2026)` EQUALS `I am entitled to be issued a passport`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, holding a passport still valid` EQUALS `the Minister must not issue me a passport`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, holding a valid passport, a Determination s 15 circumstance` EQUALS `I am entitled to be issued a passport`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, his expired passport suspended` EQUALS `the Minister must not issue me a passport`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, a s 12 request` EQUALS `the Minister must not issue me a passport`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, a s 13 request` EQUALS `I am entitled, but the Minister may refuse me`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, two passports lost in 5 years` EQUALS `I am entitled, but the Minister may refuse me`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, no fee paid` EQUALS `it is not a valid application: the approved form and the fee are needed`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for a passport` `Jake, 19, a misleading statement suspected` EQUALS `it may not be processed, the fee is kept and I must apply afresh`

